WEBVTT

00:02.043 --> 00:04.796
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

01:32.884 --> 01:33.718
Here it is.

01:33.802 --> 01:34.636
THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF
FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS.

01:34.719 --> 01:35.595
MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION
TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS.

01:35.678 --> 01:38.556
Do you not wear a hairpin?

01:39.140 --> 01:40.934
Go wear that then.

01:41.559 --> 01:42.936
<i>I promised him,</i>

01:43.019 --> 01:44.562
<i>so I guess I have no choice.</i>

01:45.980 --> 01:47.023
MAOMAO

01:47.106 --> 01:48.900
Take a look, Mr. Luomen.

01:49.484 --> 01:50.777
This kitty is smart.

01:50.860 --> 01:53.738
When she eats fish,
she leaves the head, tail and innards.

01:53.822 --> 01:57.450
I personally enjoy
the bitter taste of those parts.

01:58.034 --> 02:00.537
<i>I was taught never to waste food,</i>

02:00.620 --> 02:02.914
<i>but I can't believe</i>
<i>he would eat the leftovers of a cat.</i>

02:04.624 --> 02:06.709
<i>He hears one thing and understands ten.</i>

02:06.793 --> 02:09.671
<i>I believe he is</i>
<i>the most skilled doctor in this county.</i>

02:09.754 --> 02:12.799
<i>The reason he is living a poor life</i>
<i>in the Pleasure District is because</i>

02:12.882 --> 02:15.677
<i>he has no greed or ambition.</i>

02:16.261 --> 02:19.305
Miss, what are you making over there?

02:19.389 --> 02:21.975
I'm preparing mugwort for
Lady Gyokuyou's moxibustion treatment.

02:22.058 --> 02:23.476
Maomao,

02:23.560 --> 02:26.729
ask Mr. Guen for his permission first.

02:26.813 --> 02:27.856
Okay…

02:30.233 --> 02:31.860
Are you going to be writing today?

02:32.443 --> 02:35.530
Yes, since I have no duties at the moment.

02:36.197 --> 02:38.491
<i>The reason my old man was not assigned</i>
<i>to the Jade Pavilion,</i>

02:38.575 --> 02:40.034
<i>but to the medical office,</i>

02:40.827 --> 02:43.037
<i>was likely</i>
<i>through Lord Jinshi's consideration.</i>

02:43.663 --> 02:46.374
<i>Currently in the rear palace,</i>

02:46.457 --> 02:48.543
<i>there is one more lady who</i>
<i>is carrying the Emperor's child.</i>

02:49.419 --> 02:50.587
<i>It's Lady Lihua.</i>

02:51.588 --> 02:54.132
<i>I hope the next child grows up healthy.</i>

02:54.883 --> 02:57.635
<i>For that to happen,</i>
<i>a safe delivery must take place.</i>

02:58.428 --> 03:00.388
<i>If my old man can assist both consorts,</i>

03:00.471 --> 03:01.806
<i>it would be a relief.</i>

03:02.390 --> 03:04.934
By the way, I heard some new maids

03:05.018 --> 03:06.769
have entered the Crystal Pavilion.

03:06.853 --> 03:10.356
You know, since the head
lady-in-waiting we met before resigned.

03:11.524 --> 03:13.192
I heard most of the new maids are older,

03:13.276 --> 03:15.987
and the atmosphere in the palace
has calmed down all of a sudden.

03:16.070 --> 03:19.741
It's good to have more experienced maids.

03:20.366 --> 03:22.911
<i>The rear palace is full of</i>
<i>young palace women,</i>

03:22.994 --> 03:25.121
<i>but there are hardly any older ones.</i>

03:25.914 --> 03:29.417
<i>The rear palace is a place to give birth</i>
<i>to the Emperor's children and raise them.</i>

03:29.500 --> 03:31.544
<i>But it's currently not doing that.</i>

03:32.253 --> 03:33.796
<i>If you think about how many children</i>

03:33.880 --> 03:36.299
<i>the current emperor has,</i>
<i>it's clear that there's a problem.</i>

03:36.799 --> 03:37.800
<i>I'm sure my old man</i>

03:37.884 --> 03:40.428
<i>has already realized it by now.</i>

03:41.471 --> 03:43.097
I think I'm done.

03:43.181 --> 03:44.140
What is it?

03:44.807 --> 03:48.394
It's a list of concerns I have
regarding the rear palace.

03:48.978 --> 03:50.355
Let me see.

03:50.855 --> 03:52.857
Mr. Luomen,
you have beautiful handwriting.

03:53.733 --> 03:54.567
<i>That's what caught your attention?</i>

03:54.651 --> 03:57.654
But these sentences sound a bit childish.

03:57.737 --> 04:00.031
Don't you think your sentences
could use more weight?

04:00.114 --> 04:01.532
It's fine as it is.

04:01.616 --> 04:04.035
There are still those here
who can only understand

04:04.118 --> 04:05.703
simple words and sentences.

04:06.537 --> 04:10.166
<i>I see. He wants the attendants and maids</i>
<i>to be able to read this.</i>

04:10.250 --> 04:13.419
Do you think I missed anything?

04:13.503 --> 04:14.963
It seems good.

04:15.755 --> 04:16.839
Mr. Guen,

04:16.923 --> 04:20.426
does your family home have paper
about this size?

04:21.094 --> 04:22.470
That size would be considered scrap,

04:22.553 --> 04:25.348
so we would turn it into pulp
and make new paper instead.

04:26.140 --> 04:30.103
If that's the case, could you sell those
to me at a lower price?

04:30.728 --> 04:31.854
I think I can.

04:32.689 --> 04:36.359
Maomao, I heard that the institute of
practical studies was opened recently.

04:36.442 --> 04:38.778
Then, could you ask them
if they can use this

04:38.861 --> 04:41.864
to practice writing?

04:43.032 --> 04:46.786
<i>So, he wants to mass-produce these</i>
<i>with the students' help?</i>

04:46.869 --> 04:48.371
I'll try to ask.

04:49.080 --> 04:50.373
Thank you.

04:50.957 --> 04:53.042
<i>He doesn't waste people or resources.</i>

04:53.126 --> 04:55.378
<i>He uses everything he can,</i>
<i>just like a merchant.</i>

04:56.379 --> 05:00.341
<i>Yet, why does he not use that ability to</i>
<i>enhance his own life?</i>

05:01.968 --> 05:04.554
I've finished preparing the mugwort,
so I will be leaving.

05:05.388 --> 05:08.641
Could I take some alcohol to
the Jade Pavilion for disinfecting?

05:09.142 --> 05:10.476
Go ahead.

05:11.352 --> 05:14.772
Also, is there anything
for relieving fatigue?

05:15.815 --> 05:19.485
<i>Lady Gyokuyou has been saying</i>
<i>she gets tired easily.</i>

05:21.946 --> 05:23.865
Hey, my clothes will rip.

05:23.948 --> 05:26.367
What's wrong, Maomao? Why are you crying?

05:27.118 --> 05:28.369
Is it this?

05:30.121 --> 05:32.332
This is not for you.

05:33.583 --> 05:36.711
<i>All right, what should I do first?</i>

05:36.794 --> 05:38.838
<i>Should I go to the institute</i>
<i>of practical studies?</i>

05:39.714 --> 05:41.758
<i>If I have it go through Lord Jinshi,</i>

05:41.841 --> 05:43.718
<i>it'll probably take time.</i>

05:46.512 --> 05:48.890
<i>I have this with me just in case…</i>

05:49.640 --> 05:51.142
<i>But the last time I wore this…</i>

05:52.310 --> 05:56.022
Isn't that the hairpin you got
from Lord Jinshi at the garden party?

05:56.105 --> 05:57.648
Why are you wearing it all of a sudden?

05:59.108 --> 06:00.068
<i>I'll wear it later.</i>

06:02.653 --> 06:06.157
This is… Luomen's handwriting.

06:06.240 --> 06:07.867
You can tell?

06:08.367 --> 06:10.578
Back when we were doing
our civil service examination,

06:10.661 --> 06:12.163
people said that you would pass

06:12.246 --> 06:14.082
if you wrote like him.

06:14.165 --> 06:16.042
So we all copied his handwriting.

06:16.709 --> 06:19.128
He had the skills
to become a great civil servant,

06:19.212 --> 06:20.880
but feeling sorry and wanting to help

06:20.963 --> 06:23.299
the sick homeless children,

06:23.382 --> 06:25.134
<i>he chose to become a physician.</i>

06:25.218 --> 06:28.971
Actually, right now,
he's back in the rear palace.

06:29.055 --> 06:31.641
Oh. I didn't know that.

06:32.558 --> 06:35.019
Is Xiolan not with you today?

06:35.645 --> 06:38.189
<i>Recently, she's been preoccupied with work</i>

06:38.272 --> 06:40.399
<i>and the rumors of the new eunuch.</i>

06:40.483 --> 06:41.984
<i>She doesn't have extra time.</i>

06:42.068 --> 06:44.487
A young eunuch, huh?

06:45.238 --> 06:47.031
I know there's
not much excitement around here,

06:47.115 --> 06:50.451
but making a fuss over them
is a bit excessive.

06:50.952 --> 06:51.994
What do you mean by that?

06:52.620 --> 06:54.372
At first, the eunuchs

06:54.455 --> 06:56.457
were placed in the southern area.

06:56.541 --> 06:59.710
But the palace women
began to neglect their duties.

06:59.794 --> 07:02.255
That's why some eunuchs were sent
to the northern area.

07:02.338 --> 07:04.090
The palace women at the clinic

07:04.173 --> 07:07.343
are saying that
the eunuchs are quite helpful.

07:07.426 --> 07:08.803
<i>The clinic, huh?</i>

07:10.096 --> 07:13.891
<i>I bet Shenlü is making good use of</i>
<i>the young eunuchs.</i>

07:13.975 --> 07:16.185
Anyways, what can I do for you today?

07:16.269 --> 07:17.103
Oh, yes.

07:17.812 --> 07:20.106
I was wondering
if you could ask the students

07:20.189 --> 07:23.317
to use this letter that my old man wrote
to practice writing?

07:23.901 --> 07:25.236
We will provide the paper.

07:26.737 --> 07:28.406
I see. You want them to write copies.

07:28.489 --> 07:30.825
-So you can distribute them, right?
-Yes.

07:32.034 --> 07:35.663
A long time ago,
I wrote something similar.

07:35.746 --> 07:38.499
At first, Luomen was writing by himself,

07:38.583 --> 07:40.877
so I felt I had to help him.

07:41.711 --> 07:43.588
<i>We wrote papers together</i>

07:43.671 --> 07:45.381
<i>to post all over the rear palace.</i>

07:46.382 --> 07:48.176
He's grown older now,

07:48.259 --> 07:51.679
so he's finally learned
how to make use of people.

07:53.055 --> 07:56.267
Have you written and posted
something similar to this before?

07:57.643 --> 08:00.229
Yes, when Luomen was a physician.

08:00.313 --> 08:02.148
So I believe it was over 20 years ago.

08:03.191 --> 08:05.902
<i>I remember we posted it</i>
<i>all over the rear palace.</i>

08:06.861 --> 08:09.530
"Don't use face powder that contains lead.

08:09.614 --> 08:11.616
Avoid strong perfumes.

08:11.699 --> 08:14.785
Don't pick palace plants
without permission."

08:15.661 --> 08:18.372
What's written is pretty much
the same from back then.

08:19.540 --> 08:21.459
<i>He posted something similar to this?</i>

08:21.542 --> 08:23.377
<i>What is this bad feeling I have?</i>

08:24.295 --> 08:26.088
I will bring you the paper later.

08:29.258 --> 08:32.470
<i>My old man must have posted it</i>
<i>out of concern for the women.</i>

08:33.471 --> 08:35.890
<i>But such notices also risked</i>
<i>giving malicious people</i>

08:35.973 --> 08:38.643
<i>bad ideas.</i>

08:39.310 --> 08:41.103
<i>The palace staff turns over</i>

08:41.187 --> 08:43.147
<i>almost entirely every two years.</i>

08:43.231 --> 08:46.400
<i>Even the consorts were replaced</i>
<i>after the late emperor's death.</i>

08:47.026 --> 08:50.029
<i>Who would still remember</i>
<i>the old notice from back then?</i>

08:50.112 --> 08:51.113
<i>That is…</i>

08:51.822 --> 08:52.657
Excuse me.

08:53.908 --> 08:55.034
Oh.

08:56.035 --> 08:57.578
You're from the Jade Pavilion.

08:57.662 --> 08:59.455
Ms. Shenlü.

08:59.956 --> 09:02.458
-Are you sick?
-Um… no.

09:03.042 --> 09:06.420
<i>How should I bring it up?</i>

09:08.714 --> 09:10.967
Oh, I brought you some alcohol.

09:11.050 --> 09:12.552
It's distilled and stronger,

09:12.635 --> 09:14.554
so I think it will be a good disinfectant.

09:14.637 --> 09:16.847
I can really have this?

09:16.931 --> 09:19.725
Yes, I made extra.

09:19.809 --> 09:22.853
Thank you. Let me prepare some tea.

09:27.108 --> 09:29.694
By the way, everyone working here is

09:29.777 --> 09:31.654
quite competent, aren't they?

09:31.737 --> 09:32.780
What do you mean by that?

09:33.364 --> 09:36.325
The typical work duration for palace women
in the rear palace is about two years,

09:36.409 --> 09:38.703
but most of the people here
have worked longer than that.

09:39.453 --> 09:41.414
Well, we're a bunch of old women.

09:42.290 --> 09:46.210
<i>If they entered in their teens or</i>
<i>twenties, they've been here over 20 years.</i>

09:46.294 --> 09:49.338
<i>Is there a reason</i>
<i>they cannot leave the rear palace?</i>

09:51.132 --> 09:53.175
We were young when we first entered.

09:54.010 --> 09:56.512
I entered the rear palace
when I was ten years old.

09:57.430 --> 10:01.309
The other women were around that age too.

10:02.476 --> 10:03.728
<i>In the current rear palace,</i>

10:03.811 --> 10:06.647
<i>such a young girl is not allowed</i>
<i>to work in the palace.</i>

10:07.148 --> 10:09.317
<i>But in the previous emperor's era…</i>

10:09.984 --> 10:12.486
<i>The late emperor would choose young girls,</i>

10:12.570 --> 10:15.406
<i>not yet of age, and steal their innocence.</i>

10:15.489 --> 10:17.408
<i>The ones he defiled</i>

10:17.491 --> 10:20.036
<i>weren't even allowed to leave.</i>

10:20.119 --> 10:22.371
<i>Once they've slept with the emperor,</i>

10:22.455 --> 10:25.249
<i>they cannot leave the rear palace,</i>
<i>even if they're ordinary palace women.</i>

10:26.208 --> 10:29.545
Nobody took us in.

10:29.629 --> 10:33.257
Not now, not ever.

10:34.050 --> 10:36.510
<i>Oh, now I see.</i>

10:37.845 --> 10:40.348
<i>Towards the rear palace, the emperor,</i>

10:40.431 --> 10:44.018
<i>and the consorts who were</i>
<i>favored by the emperor…</i>

10:44.685 --> 10:47.355
<i>This is where their malice festered.</i>

10:49.190 --> 10:50.399
<i>Previously Shenlü</i>

10:50.483 --> 10:53.694
<i>asked me to check on a maid who had</i>
<i>fallen ill at the Crystal Pavilion,</i>

10:53.778 --> 10:55.946
<i>as she was deeply worried about her.</i>

10:56.030 --> 10:59.367
<i>At that time, I thought</i>
<i>she was an attentive person.</i>

10:59.450 --> 11:00.284
<i>But perhaps…</i>

11:00.951 --> 11:03.621
<i>Maybe it was Shenlü who taught Lady Shin,</i>

11:03.704 --> 11:05.956
<i>the head lady-in-waiting</i>
<i>of the Crystal Pavilion,</i>

11:06.040 --> 11:07.291
<i>how to make the abortion medicine.</i>

11:08.292 --> 11:09.794
<i>Although not directly,</i>

11:09.877 --> 11:13.172
<i>what if she used that bedridden maid</i>
<i>to do so?</i>

11:15.674 --> 11:18.219
I can't stop coughing.

11:18.302 --> 11:19.512
Let me take a look.

11:20.179 --> 11:22.973
Is it contagious?

11:23.057 --> 11:24.725
Is there something concerning?

11:24.809 --> 11:27.686
I don't want to get Lady Lihua sick.

11:28.479 --> 11:32.441
She may be pregnant.

11:32.525 --> 11:33.359
Oh…

11:33.943 --> 11:36.695
Give this to Shin,
the head lady-in-waiting.

11:36.779 --> 11:38.030
What is it?

11:38.114 --> 11:40.574
A list of things to avoid
during a pregnancy.

11:40.658 --> 11:43.536
If you combine some of those things,
it can become an abortion medicine.

11:44.537 --> 11:46.914
I'm sure it will be useful for Lady Lihua.

11:48.457 --> 11:49.959
<i>The things to avoid also teach</i>

11:50.042 --> 11:54.422
<i>what poison is</i>
<i>to those with ill intentions.</i>

11:55.840 --> 11:57.508
<i>That's when the caravan came,</i>

11:57.591 --> 11:59.969
<i>and the ingredients on the list</i>
<i>happened to be sold.</i>

12:01.095 --> 12:03.097
<i>There's no way</i>
<i>she would miss this opportunity.</i>

12:04.181 --> 12:06.100
<i>Why were such ingredients being sold?</i>

12:06.183 --> 12:07.852
<i>Maybe some palace women at the clinic</i>

12:07.935 --> 12:11.605
<i>were telling the sellers that</i>
<i>they wanted a certain perfume.</i>

12:12.356 --> 12:15.943
<i>We can't say for sure that the clinic</i>
<i>was involved with all the incidents.</i>

12:16.026 --> 12:18.279
<i>But this slow, creeping malice,</i>

12:18.362 --> 12:20.990
<i>short of outright murder, must have</i>
<i>been eating away at the rear palace</i>

12:21.073 --> 12:22.741
<i>for some time now.</i>

12:25.661 --> 12:27.538
<i>Should I press her further?</i>

12:28.456 --> 12:29.915
Is something the matter?

12:30.416 --> 12:32.084
It's nothing.

12:32.168 --> 12:34.295
Oh, okay then.

12:35.421 --> 12:37.506
<i>I'll stop for now.</i>

12:37.590 --> 12:39.383
<i>I don't have any proof or any witnesses.</i>

12:39.467 --> 12:41.594
<i>I don't want to make vague accusations.</i>

12:41.677 --> 12:44.472
<i>This is the only place</i>
<i>where the sick palace women</i>

12:44.555 --> 12:47.308
<i>can feel safe.</i>
<i>I don't want to take that away from them.</i>

12:48.058 --> 12:51.270
<i>The only thing I can do is</i>

12:51.353 --> 12:54.231
<i>prevent this malice from spreading.</i>

12:54.315 --> 12:55.441
Um…

12:55.941 --> 12:58.360
Thank you. I will be taking my leave.

13:00.613 --> 13:03.616
If there are any books you'd like
to borrow, please go ahead.

13:03.699 --> 13:05.451
But just don't forget to return them.

13:06.285 --> 13:07.953
There are so many books.

13:08.496 --> 13:11.999
For some reason, the number of books
on that shelf seems to be increasing.

13:12.583 --> 13:14.502
It would be fine if they just return it.

13:15.377 --> 13:18.047
This is quite
an impressive insect encyclopedia.

13:18.797 --> 13:21.008
Someone left that on the bookshelf too.

13:21.717 --> 13:23.761
Maybe a month ago.

13:27.556 --> 13:28.891
This is…

13:28.974 --> 13:32.478
<i>If it was one month ago, that would've</i>
<i>been after the envoy's banquet.</i>

13:33.103 --> 13:34.313
<i>Come to think of it…</i>

13:34.396 --> 13:36.565
This place is amazing!

13:36.649 --> 13:39.235
It's full of insects
from the encyclopedia!

13:39.818 --> 13:42.988
<i>Did Shisui leave this encyclopedia here?</i>

13:43.572 --> 13:47.493
<i>But could a mere maid own</i>
<i>such an impressive book?</i>

13:49.203 --> 13:51.622
<i>Thinking back,</i>
<i>when Shisui was drawing insects,</i>

13:51.705 --> 13:54.083
<i>she was using a paper notebook.</i>

13:54.166 --> 13:55.876
<i>Plus, she was able to read.</i>

13:56.585 --> 13:58.504
<i>Why is she working as a maid then?</i>

14:00.548 --> 14:03.968
Shenlü, be careful of that girl.

14:04.051 --> 14:06.470
<i>It's a high-pitched voice for a man.</i>

14:06.554 --> 14:08.973
<i>But a deep voice for a woman.</i>

14:09.056 --> 14:11.475
<i>He's short for a man.</i>

14:12.351 --> 14:14.228
<i>But tall for a woman.</i>

14:15.020 --> 14:20.734
<i>She's handsome enough to make</i>
<i>the ladies squeal…</i>

14:22.820 --> 14:24.822
<i>It's Suirei.</i>

14:26.657 --> 14:29.159
Shenlü, she has managed to
see through what you have done

14:29.243 --> 14:30.911
from your conversation.

14:33.122 --> 14:34.915
She's sharp as usual.

14:35.499 --> 14:38.043
Because of her,
I couldn't become a dead body.

14:38.127 --> 14:40.129
<i>Should I scream?</i>

14:40.212 --> 14:42.840
<i>Or should I throw a bottle of alcohol</i>
<i>at her and make a run for it?</i>

14:42.923 --> 14:46.218
Don't think about doing anything stupid.
I'll hurt you if you move.

14:46.302 --> 14:50.097
If you kill me here,
you'll be caught right away.

14:50.723 --> 14:52.641
I'd like to settle this peacefully.

14:55.394 --> 14:57.563
Is it an aftereffect
of the revival medicine?

14:58.898 --> 15:00.983
<i>After the assassination attempt</i>
<i>at the mid festival,</i>

15:01.066 --> 15:03.694
<i>you "died" by drinking poison.</i>

15:03.777 --> 15:05.821
<i>You made it look that way.</i>

15:06.572 --> 15:09.742
The medicine only put you
in a temporary death-like state,

15:09.825 --> 15:11.493
but there are lingering effects.

15:12.202 --> 15:13.454
So, what?

15:13.537 --> 15:15.664
Let me tell you what I want.

15:16.248 --> 15:17.458
Do you think I will listen?

15:17.541 --> 15:18.667
You have no other choice.

15:21.170 --> 15:22.713
Shisui!

15:22.796 --> 15:25.466
<i>So she was the owner</i>
<i>of that insect encyclopedia.</i>

15:26.342 --> 15:27.843
Sorry, Maomao…

15:27.927 --> 15:30.471
Do you not care what happens to her?

15:31.430 --> 15:32.890
What do you want me to do?

15:32.973 --> 15:35.434
I want you to leave
the rear palace with me.

15:35.517 --> 15:38.479
Leave the rear palace?
That's not possible…

15:38.562 --> 15:40.731
It is. And…

15:40.814 --> 15:43.150
I know that you will come with me.

15:45.819 --> 15:47.488
<i>Don't you want to know</i>

15:48.155 --> 15:50.115
how to make the revival medicine?

15:53.702 --> 15:56.080
<i>What is she saying?</i>

15:57.164 --> 15:59.833
<i>As I thought, Suirei is dangerous.</i>

16:04.046 --> 16:07.841
<i>There are two beasts in the palace.</i>
<i>One to the East and one to the West.</i>

16:07.925 --> 16:11.261
<i>The military resides in the East,</i>
<i>so one beast is a military officer.</i>

16:11.971 --> 16:14.974
<i>The West represents the civil officials,</i>
<i>so the other beast is one of them.</i>

16:15.766 --> 16:17.643
<i>In other words, the grand commandant.</i>

16:17.726 --> 16:21.397
<i>The high-ranking military officer Lakan</i>
<i>is the fox of the East.</i>

16:21.480 --> 16:23.691
<i>A prominent figure since the days</i>
<i>of the former leader</i>

16:23.774 --> 16:25.901
<i>is Shishou, who governs Shihoku-shu.</i>

16:25.985 --> 16:27.987
<i>He is the raccoon dog of the West.</i>

16:28.654 --> 16:29.738
What has brought you here?

16:30.322 --> 16:31.865
Oh, nothing special.

16:31.949 --> 16:35.786
It's been a month since the Emperor's
younger brother attended the court council

16:35.869 --> 16:38.414
so I was thinking
we could have tea after this.

16:39.039 --> 16:40.666
It's a great opportunity,

16:40.749 --> 16:43.502
so why not join me, Sir Shishou?

16:44.753 --> 16:45.921
Me?

16:46.714 --> 16:50.092
Although I don't have
any interesting stories to share.

16:52.594 --> 16:54.805
He says he will join.

16:54.888 --> 16:58.767
All right.
Let's head to the courtyard then.

17:00.352 --> 17:03.772
What beautiful autumn weather.

17:04.565 --> 17:06.316
I have them served in silver cups,

17:06.400 --> 17:09.028
so there is no need for a food taster.

17:16.994 --> 17:18.662
He says it tastes delicious.

17:20.622 --> 17:24.126
Lakan, is there something
you would like to discuss?

17:24.793 --> 17:26.962
The other day, there was
an attempted assassination

17:27.046 --> 17:29.757
of the Emperor's younger brother
in Shihoku-shu, wasn't there?

17:29.840 --> 17:34.094
During that investigation,
we got our hands on something interesting.

17:35.679 --> 17:38.348
A design for a feifa?!

17:39.099 --> 17:43.062
Do you have any idea what this is,
Lord Shishou?

17:44.521 --> 17:46.398
What is this?

17:46.982 --> 17:49.818
It's the weapon that
the culprits were carrying.

17:49.902 --> 17:51.111
Isn't that right?

17:53.363 --> 17:55.365
Excuse me, please continue.

17:55.991 --> 17:59.703
This is a diagram of the weapon.

17:59.787 --> 18:02.039
It seems to be the newest model
from the West.

18:02.122 --> 18:05.209
Here, instead of a matchlock,

18:05.292 --> 18:07.169
there's a flint attached here.

18:07.252 --> 18:11.381
Which means fewer misfires
and the build is rather simple.

18:11.465 --> 18:14.510
That is impressive.

18:14.593 --> 18:17.805
If we mass produce these,

18:17.888 --> 18:20.599
the way we fight will definitely change.

18:20.682 --> 18:23.811
We can fight in a tighter formation
and move more freely.

18:23.894 --> 18:25.604
I can't believe such weapons

18:25.687 --> 18:29.858
ended up in the hands of someone
targeting the emperor's brother…

18:29.942 --> 18:34.071
I wonder how they
got their hands on these?

18:37.825 --> 18:39.660
I wonder?

18:42.204 --> 18:45.624
Isn't it your job to investigate that?

18:45.707 --> 18:47.918
You can say that, but…

18:48.001 --> 18:50.045
Well, there's been a small problem.

18:50.838 --> 18:53.966
Someone in that department
got a little too rough with the culprits.

18:54.049 --> 18:56.260
So none of those captured
are able to speak now.

18:57.511 --> 19:00.931
<i>There's no mercy for those</i>
<i>who plot against the royals,</i>

19:01.014 --> 19:04.560
<i>but botching the torture?</i>
<i>That's a costly mistake.</i>

19:04.643 --> 19:06.103
So I was wondering

19:06.186 --> 19:09.439
if you have heard of anything about that,

19:09.523 --> 19:10.691
Lord Shishou?

19:11.358 --> 19:14.444
If I knew,
I would've reported it long ago.

19:15.445 --> 19:17.447
I see. What a shame.

19:18.282 --> 19:20.993
Let's get to the main discussion then.

19:21.952 --> 19:25.789
It's a diagram of the game of Go
my wife and I played yesterday.

19:26.623 --> 19:28.500
Wife…?

19:28.584 --> 19:32.838
Come to think of it, you recently
got married, didn't you, Lakan?

19:32.921 --> 19:33.964
Yes, I did.

19:34.548 --> 19:38.427
I heard the celebrations went on
for seven days and nights.

19:38.510 --> 19:41.722
You even know that?

19:41.805 --> 19:44.975
She's a sharp one, my wife.

19:45.058 --> 19:47.769
Every move she makes is
like a finely sharpened blade.

19:47.853 --> 19:50.939
I can't tell you how many times my heart
raced while we were playing.

19:51.023 --> 19:53.192
Look at this move! I would escape,

19:53.275 --> 19:55.611
but then she would get me
on the next move!

19:56.445 --> 19:59.031
<i>How long do we have to</i>
<i>listen to this story?</i>

19:59.114 --> 20:01.200
-And then--
-I apologize but…

20:01.283 --> 20:03.660
I have business to attend to.
I will take my leave.

20:03.744 --> 20:05.412
Thank you for the drink.

20:05.495 --> 20:07.122
What a shame.

20:07.873 --> 20:10.584
I'll make sure to send you a copy
of the diagram

20:10.667 --> 20:12.961
and my commentary notes along with it.

20:13.045 --> 20:14.755
No, there's no need to.

20:14.838 --> 20:17.591
No need to hesitate. Also,

20:17.674 --> 20:20.552
would you like a glass of grape juice?

20:21.303 --> 20:23.347
The red color really stands out

20:23.430 --> 20:25.557
in a glass cup.

20:27.893 --> 20:30.520
Indeed, it's beautiful.

20:31.813 --> 20:32.940
Right?

20:33.732 --> 20:35.817
I feel like you and I will get along well.

20:35.901 --> 20:38.695
I'd like to chat more
about my wife sometime.

20:38.779 --> 20:40.948
Maybe next time. Farewell.

20:45.035 --> 20:48.622
This juice has an unusual color,
doesn't it?

20:49.581 --> 20:50.958
There are even grapes out there

20:51.041 --> 20:53.335
with a ‘green' hue.

20:54.169 --> 20:56.880
<i>That's clearly green, not red…</i>

20:56.964 --> 20:59.716
<i>Why didn't Lord Shishou say anything</i>

20:59.800 --> 21:01.593
<i>when he said it was red?</i>

21:02.928 --> 21:04.888
Just as my uncle said…

21:09.977 --> 21:12.062
May I fix my hair?

21:12.688 --> 21:14.481
Go ahead.

21:14.564 --> 21:16.900
I'll keep watch to make sure no one comes.

21:17.526 --> 21:19.611
Finally, I can take off this mask.

21:26.702 --> 21:29.705
Wearing platform shoes
is quite exhausting.

21:30.205 --> 21:32.249
I'm sorry for asking you
for such a request.

21:32.833 --> 21:36.503
Standing in for the Crown Prince
isn't something you get to do every day.

21:36.586 --> 21:37.963
I quite enjoyed it.

21:38.922 --> 21:42.467
<i>Looking at her, she's like</i>
<i>a beautiful civil servant.</i>

21:42.551 --> 21:46.471
<i>Who would guess this is Lady Ah-Duo,</i>
<i>the former high-ranking consort?</i>

21:46.555 --> 21:50.350
The fox was so eccentric
that it made the raccoon dog seem normal.

21:50.434 --> 21:53.645
No one stands a chance
against the General.

21:53.729 --> 21:55.397
He seems to have a soft spot
for his wife though.

21:55.981 --> 21:57.899
Yes, and his daughter too.

21:57.983 --> 22:00.652
<i>To think she's the General's daughter…</i>

22:01.361 --> 22:04.573
But isn't he scrambling to deal with
the situation with that girl?

22:04.656 --> 22:06.450
The eunuch, Jinshi.

22:08.535 --> 22:11.955
<i>To think she would go missing…</i>

23:46.049 --> 23:49.094
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

23:57.477 --> 24:00.272
<i>The next episode is</i>
<i>"The Village of Foxes."</i>

24:00.355 --> 24:01.857
Subtitle translation by: Melissa Nishizaki
